  "scope": "One matched opening-three P-CREW OUT quantity contrast at h7.75: OUT1 versus OUT2, with exactly one initially idle crew and two occupied until h8. Prospective one immediate plus one later positive tranche in child; source-specific fixed seed, two waves, zero TFDT, BASE-01 to OUT, horizon36 only.",
